  "releaseNotes": "* Adds explicit business-context severity metadata (additive, non-breaking):\n  reserved tags faultlens.operation.criticality, faultlens.workflow, faultlens.job\n  and IFaultLensRequestScope.SetOperationCriticality / SetWorkflow / SetJob helpers.\n* Narrows faultlens.operation to service operation / route name (workflow and job\n  now have their own reserved tags).\n* Includes the 1.0.2 package-health improvements: Source Link, symbol package, and\n  deterministic release build metadata; project URL and repository metadata for consumers.",
